<title>HONG KONG: Termbray Ind posts higher interim profit.</title>
<headline>Termbray Ind posts higher interim profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   59.5   vs 52.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    81.23  vs 71.22</p>
<p>    Turnover		     641.80 vs 561.29</p>
<p>    Company name		 Termbray Industries International</p>
<p>				     (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
